================================================================================
1. Upstream origin of the replay and video-render core
================================================================================

SpectreReplay is GPL-3.0 because it is a derivative work. The replay engine and
the video-render pipeline were ported from the Spectre project, which is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3.

    Upstream project:  Spectre (a mod for A Dance of Fire and Ice)
    Upstream license:  GNU General Public License, version 3

What is derived from that upstream:

  * the replay engine        - per-frame input capture, the .sprp/.crpl binary
                               replay format (magic, versioning, metadata,
                               hit-context records), AES + gzip encoding,
                               decoding, playback scheduling and key injection;
  * the video-render pipeline - offscreen frame capture, timeline pinning,
                               ffmpeg process piping and argument assembly,
                               container muxing and format conversion,
                               audio capture from the game's mixdown bus;
  * the keyboard-sound capture path that records microphone input to WAV and
    re-attaches it to a replay.

These parts stay under GPL-3.0. They must not be relicensed, and any
redistribution must keep both this notice and the license text in `LICENSE`.

Not derived from that upstream: the declarative patch layer, the settings
model, the self-drawn settings UI, and the localisation tables in this
repository were written for SpectreReplay.


================================================================================
2. Third-party components
================================================================================

The following components are used by SpectreReplay. A component listed as
"not distributed" is only referenced at compile or run time and is not shipped
with this project.

  ffmpeg              https://ffmpeg.org/
                      Separate command-line executable, invoked as a child
                      process and never linked into SpectreReplay. Distributed
                      under its own license: LGPL-2.1-or-later for a default
                      build, GPL-2.0-or-later for a build configured with
                      --enable-gpl. If an ffmpeg binary is shipped next to the
                      mod, that copy is redistributed unmodified and is
                      governed by the license of the build it came from.

  libx264 (x264)      https://www.videolan.org/developers/x264.html
                      H.264 software encoder, compiled into the ffmpeg build
                      that is used for CPU encoding. Licensed GPL-2.0-or-later;
                      this is what makes a typical bundled ffmpeg build a GPL
                      build.

  Harmony             https://github.com/pardeike/Harmony
                      Runtime method patching library (prefix/postfix/
                      transpiler). MIT License. Not distributed: it is supplied
                      at run time by the game's mod loader.

  UnityModManager     https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/21
                      Mod loader used to load, configure and toggle this mod.
                      Not distributed with SpectreReplay.

  Unity Engine        https://unity.com/
                      Runtime the mod runs inside. Not distributed.

  Newtonsoft.Json     https://www.newtonsoft.com/json
                      JSON serialisation for the settings file. MIT License.


